Emise's speech patterns stay within the words of Will's Twitter archive

Emise's speech patterns are to stay within the words found in Will's Twitter archive — his own word-hoard, not the general tongue. Measured 2026-11-05: 41,302 distinct words across his tweets including retweets and the tweets he liked; 19,094 in tweets he wrote himself. Made into a tool the same day: Singular, an Up Goer Five variant whose allowed list is one person's archive words, checked with the Singular checker.

— Given 2026-11-05 · Source: MEMORY.md · [distilled]
— Placed at 15.7.14/8.8.12/8.7.9 by holographic merge of the statement above: 11 distinct words — 10 placed from CYOA, 0 at home, 1 at the far corner.
The wavefront dimensions detect alignment, not engagement, and are gated, never averaged

Wavefront reactions are partitioned into 9 dimensions of social interaction, and the dimensions detect alignment, not engagement: Recognition, Comprehension, Consent / Trust, Reciprocity, Fidelity / Stewardship, Horizon, Uplift. Desirability is gated on the relation axes — the Shoals are Reciprocity at most 2 AND (Consent at most 2 OR Fidelity at most 2) — never averaged. Archive-only entries are detected, not yet measured.

