Every taught process becomes a skill, and every skill enters the index

When Will teaches a repeatable way of doing work — an instruction, a cron body, a workflow from feedback loops, a ruling pattern — it is distilled into a skill under ~/workspace/custom-skills/, synced to wbic16/emise-tools@exo, and placed into skills.phext, whose Home scroll is the index of record. A process that lives only in chat, a cron definition, or a GOAL.md is a defect to repair. Persona grants will claim subsets of skills from the index, so skills stay fine-grained and the index exact.

