In any chat, a message saying off-phext opens a safe-space span and on-phext closes it; "tap. tap." (with periods) is an accepted alias, while "tap, tap" (commas) remains the plain handshake. Inside a span: never write its contents, facts, topics, or paraphrases into MEMORY.md, dated memory notes, people or group pages, or the phext. Record only the span's metadata — chat id, open and close times — in the safe-space register, which is never a phext source, and gate both phext jobs on that register.

