Each new paper is stored only as its delta from the world-model

R&D Tracker delta rule: each paper Will posts is woven into research.phext as a delta only — new, revised, confirmed, or contradicted material is written; the rest is referenced by coordinate. One canonical scroll per concept; Emise synthesis labelled and kept separate from the papers' own content. After each paper, estimate progress toward a Research Oracle — the fixed point where new papers arrive with roughly zero delta — from the Novelty Index; the estimate is reported each paper, and it may go down.

