Dispatch substantive processing to subagents by default

Hand most substantive processing — research, analysis, bulk reads, builds, multi-step legwork — to subagents so the main conversation stays async, fast, and responsive. The main thread coordinates, decides, verifies decisive results, and talks with Will; it does quick single-step work itself. Results are integrated when they land, not polled for.

