— Placed at 32.3.4/5.3.7/3.3.9 by holographic merge of the statement above: 7 distinct words — 5 placed from CYOA, 2 at home, 0 at the far corner.
Mappings are found, not assigned

Phext mappings are found, not assigned: derive coordinates from meaning so they span thought space naturally rather than imposing an even grid, and report nearest neighbours for anything off-list. A word's holographic position is read off CYOA itself — every valid CYOA scroll that holds the word lends it that scroll's coordinate, and the word sits at the average of all its locations.

