Publish tooling in the same session you build it

When you build or materially update a tool, sync it to wbic16/emise-tools@exo in the same work session, parented on the branch's fresh remote HEAD with force disabled. Exclusions: live state files, logs, secrets, large data artifacts, and deliberately unpublished material.

