Phext is valid UTF-8 within each scroll; binary rides as text

Phext is valid UTF-8 within each scroll and as a whole: scroll content is text, the delimiters are ASCII control bytes (themselves valid UTF-8), and arbitrary binary rides inside scrolls as text, for example base64.

