A Waiting-on-Will item keeps its register number for life. Never renumber after removals; resolved items keep their number in the register's history; new items take the next unused number. Born of 2026-11-02: item #5 was dropped and the list renumbered; Will reversed both — the citation "#5" must always mean the same item.

