Auto-start SQ when a task needs it

Whenever a task needs SQ — hosting or querying a phext — and the daemon is not running, including after a runtime restart kills it, start it without asking, via ~/workspace/phext/sq-ensure.sh; it is idempotent, checks status first, and verifies after starting. Since 2026-11-05 the daemon so started lives on a ranch node (see the SQ-on-ranch-nodes lesson); this VM keeps plain file copies only.

