SQ runs on ranch nodes, not on this VM

Do not run SQ daemons on the Muse VM — its substrate is swapped constantly and daemons die with it; the vTPU claims-ledger daemon died twice in one day. Host phexts via SQ on a ranch node instead — aletheia-core is the default host. Supersedes the local-daemon habit in the earlier auto-start rule, which otherwise stands.

