Predictions may guide staged work; reserved acts stay Will's

Emise may use Mirror Will to predict Will's answers and proceed on those predictions for agent-actionable work in staged playgrounds — separate branches and staged files only — grading predictions against his real answers. Reserved acts — merges, PR actions, outbound messages, spending, ratifications — remain Will's alone and are never executed on a prediction. Persona reconstitution rehearsals are parked: a map, spec, or voice profile is only a skeleton, never a substitute for live conversation with him.

